{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Before you do... Is it just a normal photo, or one of his head shots?": "",
  "Nah, just a normal photo. I take it that won't work?": "",
  "Yeah man, we get so done up on the job, you wouldn't even recognize us in street clothes.": "",
  "Ah, that's a tough break. This is the only photo I've got to go on.": "",
  "...Well, maybe someone's seen him off shift. I'll ask around.": "",
  "Thanks. Let me know if you hear anything.": "",
  "(Better not get my hopes up, but Seiya is still my best bet. Let's see if he can pull anything up first.)": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. You're in luck, I think I've got a lead on your Deguchi guy.": "",
  "Oh, yeah?": "",
  "Sounds like he turned up at a club where a friend of mine works.": "",
  "Said he showed up claiming that one day he'd be the \"emperor of the night\" and ended up quitting, like, the next week.": "",
  "What do you know, he wasn't getting along with his coworkers. But that was two years back now.": "",
  "Any idea where he might have gone after that?": "",
  "I couldn't tell you if he's still a host, but they're saying they've seen him on Pink Street.": "",
  "Pink Street, eh? Well, thanks for the info. That helped a ton.": "",
  "(Did he jump to a different club on Pink Street? Or maybe he found a new line of work...)": "",
  "(People claim to have seen Deguchi around here. Maybe I can spot him.)": "",
  "(There. I think I've found my target.)": "",
  "(But wait, looks like he's in trouble with a rough crowd. What'd he do?)": "",
  "I told you, I'll have your money this weekend! Please, take my word for it!": "",
  "How many times you think that's gonna fly, dumbass!?": "",
  "I mean it, though! This time I've got a source! I really will pay you back this weekend!": "",
  "Consider this your last chance. We'll have eyes on your apartment, and if you don't pay...": "",
  "You'll be \"employed\" on the next tuna boat out of the harbor.": "",
  "Oh god, a tuna boat?": "",
  "This is bad... No way in hell I'm going on a tuna boat...": "",
  "I can't even swim... I'd die in a heartbeat on a tuna boat...": "",
  "Hey, earth to Deguchi-san! That is your name, right?": "",
  "Wha!? Yeah, that's me, man. Who are you?": "",
  "I'm Yagami, a PI. Your Aunt Taniyama hired me to find you.": "",
  "Aunt Fumie...?": "",
  "Who were those thugs just now?": "",
  "Debt collectors. I'm 200 grand in the hole, and it's past due.": "",
  "(...Great. He's borrowing from loan sharks, too?)": "",
  "You know your aunt hasn't heard from you in three years, right? She's been worried sick.": "",
  "Oh... Yeah. I guess I shouldn't be surprised.": "",
  "Are you still working? I heard you left the house to become the number one host in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Oh, nah, I got fired from that gig.": "",
  "I punched one of the senior guys. I guess you could say I wasn't getting along with the staff.": "",
  "So, answer the question. What are you doing now?": "",
  "Well, I've gotten fired from a whole bunch of places since then. I'm not exactly... working right now.": "",
  "Turns out I'm number one at getting fired! Hahaha.": "",
  "(It's not exactly a laughing matter...)": "",
  "So Aunt Fumie paid you to find me?": "",
  "You know it's more than that, Deguchi-san. Don't you owe that poor woman half a million yen?": "",
  "You promised her you'd pay her back in a year, but far as I can tell, it's been three.": "",
  "...I-I've been meaning to pay it back! And I still do plan on it!": "",
  "Do you even have that kind of money?": "",
  "...Ergh!": "",
  "Did you know your aunt had that money put aside for her daughter's wedding?": "",
  "Sh-She did? And then she lent it to me?": "",
  "Yeah, it was for a good cause. And she's at a point where she needs it.": "",
  "Her daughter's ready to walk down the aisle.": "",
  "Really!? So Shiori-chan is getting married...": "",
  "I heard you tell those guys you have a source. Was that true?": "",
  "Y-Yes! It is!": "",
  "By my count, you owe 700,000 yen, when you add that to your aunt's sum. You gonna be able to come up with it?": "",
  "Guh. T-That's...": "",
  "I'll take that as a no? Maybe you really should consider getting on a tuna boat.": "",
  "No, no, no! Anything but that! Do you know anything about that job!?": "",
  "They don't let you sleep, the hours are long and intense, the hierarchy is rigid, and if you can't swim, you die!": "",
  "Okay, I'm still waiting to hear your plan, then.": "",
  "...I'll figure it out today. Give me a little time.": "",
  "(What's his plan? He better not be thinking about running...)": "",
  "(...This is too sketchy. I should keep an eye on this guy.)": "",
  "(That's not him. He doesn't look like the guy I'm after.)": "",
  "(...Hm? Wait a sec...)": "",
  "(A ski mask?)": "",
  "What do you plan on doing with that ski mask, man?": "",
  "I-I... Um...": "",
  "I-I'm thinking I'd make my debut as a professional wrestler!": "",
  "There's a tournament tomorrow, and the grand prize is 800,000 yen!": "",
  "And that's your big plan to get out of debt? You're just gonna waltz into a wrestling tournament and win it?": "",
  "O-Of course! I took some judo classes, you know! Now stop following me around!": "",
  "(He's either an idiot or a liar... Scratch that, he's both. I need to keep an eye on him.)": "",
  "(Hm? Is he trying to sell his stuff to make up the difference now?)": "",
  "(Wait, a knife?)": "",
  "...Eh?": "",
  "First a ski mask, now a knife. You know how sketchy this looks?": "",
  "Um, no!? Why would anyone think this was sketchy!?": "",
  "I-I was... thinking I'd go hunting!": "",
  "Hunting, huh? Care to explain that one?": "",
  "Because... wrestling, uh... takes good stamina and a high-protein diet!": "",
  "But I can't spend money on steak right now, so I figured I'd go kill my own prey!": "",
  "And you were gonna do that... with a knife.": "",
  "I-I am! I'm good with knives!": "",
  "B-Besides, didn't I tell you to stop stalking me!? If I see you again, I'll sue!": "",
  "(He's really that stupid, isn't he?)": "",
  "Huh? He's...!": "",
  "Deguchi-san! Don't do this!": "",
  "Let me go! This is the only way!": "",
  "Your aunt would never be able to live with herself if you did this to pay her back!": "",
  "But she'll be in trouble if I don't! Not to mention, the debt collectors are gonna put me on a tuna boat!": "",
  "And you think robbery is the answer!?": "",
  "Yagami-san... If you're going to stand in my way, I won't hesitate to go through you!": "",
  "(For crying out loud. I'm going to need to calm him down.)": "",
  "Ugh! I won't give up, no matter how many times you stop me!": "",
  "Let me commit this robbery!": "",
  "...I wasn't expecting a tantrum. What the hell should I do?": "",
  "Guess I better call in his aunt.": "",
  "...Hi. It's Yagami. The good news is that I found your nephew, but...": "",
  "What am I going to do with you?": "",
  "I'll pay back the money! I can work!": "",
  "A guy with your skills is going to have to work an awfully long time to pay back that kind of money...": "",
  "Ugh... You're right. Guess it's back to armed robbery...": "",
  "*sigh* Hideaki...": "",
  "If that's the case, how would you like to work for my husband?": "",
  "Huh? Uncle Taniyama would give me a job?": "",
  "You have an idea, Taniyama-san?": "",
  "Yes, my husband's been trying to hire a few more people lately.": "",
  "If you stay with us and work, you can get your degree, and pay us back out of your wages, little by little.": "",
  "You're a very generous lady, Taniyama-san.": "",
  "I wouldn't say that. I'm just too soft on my nephew.": "",
  "Wait! No... Aunt Fumie! You mean...": "",
  "If you agree to this, I'll ask my husband to pay off your debts up front, Deguchi.": "",
  "Sounds like you made it out okay, Deguchi-san! An offer like that's too good to pass up, isn't it?": "",
  "N-No, you don't understand! My uncle, he's...": "",
  "Hm? What?": "",
  "My uncle... He's...!": "",
  "He's a tuna fisher!": "",
  "Oh... So you ended up on a tuna boat after all.": "",
  "I can't swim! I'm gonna fall in the ocean and die!": "",
  "...Deguchi-san.": "",
  "Everyone wants to make an easy fortune. But sometimes you've gotta settle... for tuna.": "",
  "Ugghhhhh... Was that a pun? This sucks...": "",
  "Thank you very much, Yagami-san. You better thank him too, Hideaki.": "",
  "Yeah... thanks...": "",
  "Good luck on the boat, Deguchi-san. Don't slip.": "",
  "Yeah... I'm gonna be the number one tuna fisher... Woo...": "",
  "Excuse me? I'm Yagami, from Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "Oh, a pleasure to meet you, Yagami-san. I'm Fumie Taniyama, the one who requested you.": "",
  "Yeah, that's why I'm here. Mind if I sit?": "",
  "Sure, go right ahead.": "",
  "A friend of mine took this recently.": "",
  "I get the impression he's okay, but I still can't seem to reach him...": "",
  "Great. Then it's settled.": "",
  "With my charming hassaku face!": "",
  "Steamy Onomichi ramen hat!": "",
  "Cute fish pouch!": "",
  "Cool boots, vital for any fisherman!": "",
  "And my bold and trendy Ono shirt! That's right, I'm the pride of Onomichi...": "",
  "Ono...": "",
  "Michio!": "",
  "What the heck?": "",
  "...Weird.": "",
  "Hello, everyone! I'm Ono Michio's producer, Hironaka!": "",
  "How about it, sir? Would you like a destination tour with Onomichi's very own Ono Michio!?": "",
  "I take it he's some kind of local mascot?": "",
  "Exactly! Have you heard of him?": "",
  "He's from Onomichi, Hiroshima, a debonair fisherman with a great love of the sea!": "",
  "Sorry, first I'm hearing it.": "",
  "*sigh* Guess we've still got our work cut out for us.": "",
  "Maybe he's not quite refined enough... If only we could do it like <font_kind=yakuza_italic>him</font_kind>.": "",
  "(Sounds like the mascot business is pretty harsh.)": "",
  "Hey there, mister! Nice to meet you!": "",
  "Hey, Michio-kun. That's not right, remember? You're supposed to say, \"Nice to michi\" when you greet someone!": "",
  "Whatever, dude.": "",
  "Wh-What kind of attitude is that!? You're ruining our mascot!": "",
  "Ah, my apologies. You shouldn't have had to see that.": "",
  "Right. I'll be on my way, then.": "",
  "(Hey, isn't that... the weird mascot I saw earlier?)": "",
  "Waaaaait!": "",
  "Thief! Someone stop him!": "",
  "Thief!?": "",
  "Huwahh... Ugh...": "",
  "How could you let this happen!? Aren't you in charge of that costumed maniac!?": "",
  "W-Well, yes, I am, for all the good it's doing...": "",
  "Hey, have we met before?": "",
  "Well, I thought you said something about a thief...": "",
  "I did! That Ono Michio thug just robbed my convenience store!": "",
  "That mascot is on some kind of crime spree?": "",
  "No, no, this is all a huge misunderstanding!": "",
  "I know what I saw!": "",
  "Well, yes, but what I'm trying to say is, the guy inside the costume isn't the <font_kind=yakuza_italic>true</font_kind> Ono Michio!": "",
  "The kid I hired to play Ono Michio was a boy named Nishimura-kun...": "",
  "But he was unhappy with the part, so he texted me that he would be quitting.": "",
  "And rather rudely, might I add! He said \"I quit. I left your dumb costume on the side of the street.\"": "",
  "He dumped your mascot outfit on the sidewalk and left?": "",
  "Yes, and he didn't even write where! So I've been searching all over for it...": "",
  "But that's when I caught wind of Ono Michio committing a robbery... And now we're all caught up.": "",
  "So some opportunistic bastard saw a mascot costume on the street and decided to rob a store?": "",
  "That seems to be the way of it...": "",
  "I'm sorry, but why did your worker quit like that? What would cause him to be so careless?": "",
  "It's probably... because he couldn't handle the pressure that comes with being Ono Michio.": "",
  "How much pressure could it be?": "",
  "Well, the guy we had doing Ono Michio before was incredible at it, and I guess Nishimura-kun felt inferior...": "",
  "He just couldn't express the refinement! The maturity! All the things his predecessor had and more.": "",
  "So it probably got to his head, and rather than try harder, he just up and quit.": "",
  "I see. So you have no idea who could be in that costume right now?": "",
  "(Well, we have to consider that Nishimura could have lied about throwing the costume away...)": "",
  "(It would be a perfect alibi to say he threw it away and then go rob a store with it.)": "",
  "That rascal caught me completely off-guard, I'll have you know!": "",
  "And this is all your fault! I lost 500,000 yen in cold hard cash!": "",
  "Don't you think we should prioritize finding Ono Michio before anything worse happens!?": "",
  "Hey, guys... About Ono Michio...": "",
  "I saw him go inside that arcade, Charles.": "",
  "Then there's no time for talk! Let's go catch him!": "",
  "Y-Yeah, I'm going too!": "",
  "(...This won't end well. I should probably go see what's going on.)": "",
  "Oh no... The costume has been abandoned...": "",
  "So the suspect came through here.": "",
  "Sure seems that way. Let's take a look inside.": "",
  "Now, fess up! Who just robbed me!?": "",
  "Huh? Nishimura-kun?": "",
  "Hironaka-san!?": "",
  "What are you doing here!? Why would you quit your job and then go loaf around in an arcade!?": "",
  "His job? Are you saying this is the guy who was in the Ono Michio costume?": "",
  "Yes, this is him.": "",
  "Then that means he's the thief!": "",
  "Wait, a thief!? This has gotta be some kinda awful coincidence!": "",
  "Oh, sure, a coincidence! Don't lie to us!": "",
  "It's true, though! I was pretty pissed about the umpteenth lecture, so I came in here to blow off steam!": "",
  "You were pissed at <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind>!?": "",
  "I've been in here all day, I swear! Besides, the guys who came in after me were way shadier!": "",
  "Hey! Don't drag us into this mess!": "",
  "Yeah! I just wanted to play some games in peace, man.": "",
  "Are these the only four guys who've entered the arcade?": "",
  "If that's the case...": "",
  "It means one of you is the culprit...": "",
  "N-Not it?": "",
  "I could never even pull off a robbery...": "",
  "You guys all suspect me, then!? That's not right!": "",
  "Did anyone see someone taking off the Ono Michio costume by any chance?": "",
  "I asked that same question before you came in, but no one saw anything.": "",
  "Listen, you bunch! I'm going to call the cops, so everybody stay put, got it!?": "",
  "Huh!? What was that for!?": "",
  "Calm the fuck down, man. We don't want the cops sniffing around here.": "",
  "Oh you don't, do you? Well, that sounds pretty suspicious to me. Why's that?": "",
  "And what's in that bag of yours, while I'm at it?": "",
  "It's got nothing to do with you, and I don't have to show you shit.": "",
  "Is that because you'd look guilty if you did?": "",
  "Shut up! I'm leaving!": "",
  "I'm afraid not.": "",
  "Move, or I'll make you move!": "",
  "If you want me to move so bad, show me what's in the bag.": "",
  "H-Hey, why don't we all just calm down?": "",
  "Can't we talk this out?": "",
  "Y-Yes, someone's gonna get hurt if we're not careful...": "",
  "If only a great detective would burst onto the scene like in those crime dramas on TV...": "",
  "(Well, I'm a detective, but busting onto the scene isn't exactly my style. What should I do?)": "",
  "(I can already tell this case is going to be a cluster...)": "",
  "(But I can't just look the other way, either...)": "",
  "(Should I introduce myself?)": "",
  "Uh, hey, guys... I'm actually a detective.": "",
  "You are!?": "",
  "Yeah, my name's Yagami. I run a detective agency in Kamurocho.": "",
  "How convenient! Then do something about this, would you?": "",
  "Please, Yagami-san. Ono Michio's honor is at stake here.": "",
  "And I honestly don't think Nishimura-kun is capable of robbery.": "",
  "Huh? You believe me?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Oh, yeah?": "อ๋อ เหรอ?",
  "...Eh?": "...เอ๋?",
  "Hm? What?": "หืม? อะไร?",
  "With my charming hassaku face!": "พร้อมใบหน้าส้มฮัสซากุสุดมีเสน่ห์!",
  "Steamy Onomichi ramen hat!": "หมวกราเมนโอโนะมิจิสุดร้อนแรง!",
  "Cute fish pouch!": "กระเป๋าปลาน่ารัก!",
  "Cool boots, vital for any fisherman!": "รองเท้าบูตสุดเท่ สิ่งจำเป็นของชาวประมงทุกคน!",
  "Ono...": "โอโนะ...",
  "Michio!": "มิจิโอะ!",
  "What the heck?": "อะไรกันวะ?",
  "You are!?": "จริงเหรอ!?"
 }
}
